ld, dealing 2.5x damage. Can be countered by Evade Cards."},"ap":"4"},{"id":"1003805","name":{"zh":"销魂","en":"Soul Seal"},"level":"3","description2":{"zh":"使目标智魂失效，持续1回合。","en":"Disables the target's Mind Spirit for 1 turn."},"ap":"1"},{"id":"1001505","name":{"zh":"赋灵击","en":"Spirit Blow"},"level":"2","description2":{"zh":"特殊攻击牌，造成1.2倍杀伤，命中后获得50点灵感。","en":"Special Attack Card. Deals 1.2x damage. On hit, gain 50 Inspiration."},"ap":"2"},{"id":"1004701","name":{"zh":"消之论","en":"Dismantling"},"level":"1","description2":{"zh":"攻击牌，造成1.2倍杀伤，拆除对方一张牌。","en":"Attack Card. Deals 1.2x damage and discards 1 of the opponent's cards."},"ap":"3"},{"id":"1005105","name":{"zh":"沁人肺腑","en":"Resounding"},"level":"2","description2":{"zh":"为自身或队友恢复2.2倍攻击的形势值，随后每回合开始时恢复0.5倍攻击的形势值，持续2回合。","en":"Restores 2.2x Attack as Momentum for yourself or a teammate, then restores 0.5x Attack at the start of each turn for 2 turns."},"ap":"1"}],"warSouls":[{"id":"S1001205","name":{"zh":"聚气[大]","en":"Qi Charge [Great]"},"level":"1","description2":{"zh":"武将蓄力点恢复速度提高22%","en":"Officer Charge Point recovery speed increased by 22%"}},{"id":"S1002105","name":{"zh":"增速","en":"Hasten"},"level":"0","description2":{"zh":"移动速度提高15%","en":"Move Speed increased by 15%"}}],"battleSouls":[{"id":"1010105","name":{"zh":"幻影神兵","en":"Phantom Soldiers"},"level":"3","description2":{"zh":"回合开始时80%几率获得一张【神兵】（1行动AP，8米范围，目标的攻击距离提高20%，反击率和暴击率提高20%），自身被攻击结算后有50%概率获得【幻影】状态。","en":"80% chance at turn start to gain a 【Divine Arms】 (1 AP, 8m range, target's Attack Range +20%, Counter and Crit +20%), and 50% chance to gain 【Phantom】 status after an attack on oneself is resolved."}}],"debateSouls":[{"id":"1006705","name":{"zh":"厚积薄发","en":"Accumulated Might"},"level":"3","description2":{"zh":"每次使用特殊牌、恢复牌、回避牌时，为自己叠加1层【厚积薄发】状态（最多10层，持续回合无限），使用攻击牌时，若使用的牌消耗的AP数大于等于4或消耗了灵感，则失去身上所有的【厚积薄发】，且每层【厚积薄发】使本次攻击额外造成10%的伤害。【厚积薄发】层数达到10层时，使用攻击牌时可额外指定一名目标。","en":"Each time a Special Card, Recovery Card, or Evade Card is used, gain 1 stack of the 【Accumulated Might】 status on self (max 10 stacks, unlimited duration). When using an Attack Card, if the AP cost of the card used is 4 or more, or if Inspiration was consumed, lose all 【Accumulated Might】 on self, and each stack of 【Accumulated Might】 causes this attack to deal an additional 10% damage. When 【Accumulated Might】 reaches 10 stacks, you may designate 1 additional target when using an Attack Card."}}],"soulPoints":{"war":6000,"battle":6000,"debate":8000},"equipment":[{"id":"WP1008102","name":{"zh":"赤尾羽扇","en":"Crimson-Tail Feather Fan"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"带有深红羽毛的扇子，或许象征着权贵。","en":"A fan with deep crimson feathers, perhaps symbolizing noble status."},"atkVal":"7","mp":"450","price":"9000","slot":{"zh":"武器","en":"Weapon"}},{"id":"WP1015402","name":{"zh":"丝绸轻衣","en":"Light Silk Garb"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"在低肩衣外套了一层如图薄纱般的丝绸衣，通常价格不菲。","en":"A silk overgarment as sheer as gauze layered over a low-shoulder dress, typically quite costly."},"defenceVal":"5","hp":"350","price":"7300","slot":{"zh":"护甲","en":"Armor"}},{"id":"WP1012702","name":{"zh":"玛瑙钗","en":"Agate Hairpin"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"带有玛瑙装饰的钗子。玛瑙又称马脑，由遥远的异族商人传入大汉的宝石，十分罕见。","en":"A hair clasp with agate decoration. Agate, also called horse-brain stone, was brought to the Han by distant foreign merchants and is extremely rare."},"evade":"8","price":"6500","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}}],"family":{"father":{"label":{"zh":"父亲","en":"Father"},"people":[{"id":"WJ1030415","code":"0"}]},"children":{"label":{"zh":"子女","en":"Children"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10243","code":"100"},{"id":"WJ11026","code":"100"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI106015","name":{"zh":"南郡黄氏","en":"The Huang clan of Nan Commandery"},"years":["0","999"],"desc":{"zh":"出自嬴姓，黄国之后。西汉邔侯黄极忠开基，东汉司徒黄尚、沔南名士黄承彦、江夏太守黄祖相继。荆襄最古老豪族之一。黄承彦为诸葛亮岳父，黄祖镇守江夏十余年射杀孙坚，为荆州士族网络核心节点。","en":"Originating from the Ying surname, descendants of the ancient State of Huang. Founded in the Western Han by Huang Jizhong, Marquis of Qi, followed successively by Minister over the Masses Huang Shang of the Eastern Han, the renowned scholar of Miannan Huang Chengyan, and Governor of Jiangxia Huang Zu. They were one of the oldest prominent clans in Jingxiang. Huang Chengyan was the father-in-law of Zhuge Liang, and Huang Zu guarded Jiangxia for over a decade and killed Sun Jian with arrows, they served as a vital hub in the gentry network of Jing Province."},"talent":{"military":"6","commerce":"2","politics":"5"}}],"friendGroups":[{"story":"S10102","members":["WJ10016","WJ10021","WJ10152"]},{"story":"S10315","members":["WJ10058","WJ10017","WJ10151","WJ10283"]},{"story":"S10315","members":["WJ10016","WJ10021","WJ10152"]},{"story":"S10302","members":["WJ10058","WJ10017","WJ10151","WJ10283"]},{"story":"S10302","members":["WJ10016","WJ10021","WJ10152"]}],"body":null,"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[[["WJ10118","小女子"],["WJ10118","小女子"],["WJ10118","this humble maiden"],["WJ10118","私め"],["WJ10118","소녀"]]],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":1,"from":"200","to":"209"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"35","startPregnantAge":"35"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1002","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[58,31,88,87,79,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1008102","armor":"WP1015402","helmet":"WP1012702"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10215","name":{"zh":"汉末三杰","en":"Three Heroes of the Late Han"},"year":"185","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1002","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[58,31,88,87,79,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1008102","armor":"WP1015402","helmet":"WP1012702"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10615","name":{"zh":"十常侍之乱","en":"Turmoil of the Ten Attendants"},"year":"188","month":"11"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1002","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"